{"availability":"available","full":"PhyberApex/kuroshiro","name":"kuroshiro","description":"BYOS for TRMNL","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":11,"forks":5,"created":"2025-05-31T19:57:14Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:23:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://phyberapex.github.io/kuroshiro/","topics":[],"demo":"https://kuroshiro-demo.phyberapex.de/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.716Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.716Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.716Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:58.497Z","stars":11,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:23.051Z","stars":11,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:20.013Z","stars":11,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.716Z","stars":11,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kuroshiro is an open-source BYOS (Bring Your Own Server) solution for the TRMNL ecosystem. Our goal is to give you more flexibility and control over your TRMNL experience, whether you're self-hosting for fun, learning, or customization. Kuroshiro bundles a NestJS API and a Vue.js UI into a single Docker image, ready to run alongside your own Postgres database.","Take the tour on the showcase site · Try the live demo","Kuroshiro is for anyone who wants to experiment, self-host, and shape their own TRMNL experience:"],"features":["Self-hosted: Your data, your rules, your server.","All-in-one: API (NestJS) + admin UI (Vue 3 + Reka UI) bundled together.","Plug & Play: Just add Postgres and go!","Fun to use: Modern, intuitive, and built for tinkerers and pros alike.","Auto Provisioning: Devices set up themselves—like magic!"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"15d3572d516f80c5e3dfe5fc09171109be46325b9d58d2c674e21ad12eac4cce","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.798Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.798Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Kuroshiro is an op